# The operator's Dockerfile copies go.mod, go.sum, and the Go sources in
# this directory, and nothing else. Everything below is documentation,
# plans, manifests, test data, a workstation's build output, or the
# media browser's Rust tree, which builds from its own context. Sending
# any of it to the daemon costs the build time and no build reads it;
# the cargo target directory is the large one, gigabytes on a
# workstation.
deploy
docs
plans
testdata
local
media-browser/target
README.md
LICENSE
/library-operator
